  "We <b>thank</b> our brains for the great i<b>de</b>a,",
  "try <b>this</b> / and <b>quick</b>ly <b>learn</b>",
  "that if we <b>eat</b> chocolate or <b>ice</b> cream / when we're <b>mad</b> or <b>sad</b>,",
  "we feel <b>bet</b>ter.",
  "<b>Same</b> process,",
  "just a <b>dif</b>ferent <b>trig</b>ger.",
  "In<b>stead</b> of this <b>hun</b>ger signal / coming from our <b>stom</b>ach,",
