  "See <b>cool</b>,",
  "<b>smoke</b> to be <b>cool</b>,",
  "feel <b>good</b>. / Re<b>peat</b>.",
  "<b>Trig</b>ger, be<b>hav</b>ior, re<b>ward</b>.",
  "And <b>each</b> time we do this,",
  "we <b>learn</b> to re<b>peat</b> the process",
